</li>
<li><p>1,000 total integration accounts</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>To learn how pricing and billing work, see the <a href="logic-apps-pricing" data-linktype="relative-path">Logic Apps pricing model</a>. For pricing rates, see <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/logic-apps/" data-linktype="external">Logic Apps pricing</a>.</p>
